BEHAVIOR bind-9815

DESCRIPTION
  Binds a socket to port 9815 on all interfaces.

CONTRACT
  INPUT sock_fd int 8
  OUTPUT status int 8
  REQUIRES bind@697435f5 make-addr-9815@00f67ec4
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH a3081b58

COMPOSITION
  addr_result = CALL make-addr-9815
  bind_result = CALL bind sock_fd addr_result.addr 16
  SET status bind_result.status
END
